message: "If you use SPOT, please cite it as below."
title: "SPOT: Selection Power Over Time"
version: 0.9.1
date-released: 2026-10-22
authors:
  - family-names: Benchehida
    given-names: Yacine
repository-code: "https://github.com/yacinebenchehida/SPOT-simulator"
url: "https://yacinebenchehida.github.io/SPOT-simulator/"
license: MIT
abstract: "Browser-based simulator of the power to detect selection at a candidate locus from allele frequencies sampled at two or more points in time, with genetic drift, haploid, diploid or haplodiploid inheritance, changing population size and low-coverage genotype calls."
keywords:
  - temporal population genomics
  - natural selection
  - statistical power
  - historical DNA
  - ancient DNA
  - museum genomics
